# Current Work Context

- Use `docs/agent_context/ARBY3_CURRENT_CONTEXT.md` as the compact handoff only
  when the task needs current milestone orientation or the user/GPT references it.
- Treat that file as a mutable handoff, not evidence and not source of truth.
- If the active milestone changes, refresh the context file before using it for
  OpenCode work.
- Do not claim real profit, milestone PASS, or production readiness from context
  files. Evidence must come from fresh artifacts supplied by the user or GPT.
